OL,4,CTravel warning as 'oversized load' due 
OL,5,Con roads                               
OL,6,GMotorists are being advised to expect  
OL,7,Gdelays as an "oversized load" is moved.
OL,9,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it would   
OL,10,Fbe escorting a vehicle carrying a      
OL,11,Flarge cable drum from Brunton Shaw UK  
OL,12,Fin Sandy Lane, Worksop, to Goole Docks 
OL,13,Ffrom 19:00 GMT on Saturday.            
OL,15,FAfter leaving Sandy Lane, the load     
OL,16,Fwill travel down Gateford Road to the  
OL,17,FA57 Worksop Road, before travelling on 
OL,18,Fthe M1, M18 and M62, then along the    
OL,19,FA161 to the docks.                     
OL,21,FIt is expected to reach the docks      
OL,22,Fbetween 04:00 and 05:00 on Sunday.G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
