OL,4,C'I want to use the voice I've always   
OL,5,Cbeen scared of'                        
OL,6,GAfter undergoing a pioneering          
OL,7,Goperation to treat her paralysed vocal 
OL,8,Gcords, a teenager keen on drama said   
OL,9,Gshe hoped the procedure would restore  
OL,10,Gthe voice she had always been "scared  
OL,11,Gto use".                               
OL,13,FCharlotte, 15, from Higham Ferrers,    
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire, was believed to be   
OL,15,Fthe first patient in the East Midlands 
OL,16,Fregion to have laryngeal reinnervation 
OL,17,Fsurgery.                               
OL,19,FIt involved connecting a healthy nerve 
OL,20,Fin the neck to the damaged nerve       
OL,21,Fcontrolling the voice box.             
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
