OL,4,CSinger meets his Forest heroes after   
OL,5,Cpublic support                         
OL,6,GA popular singer who felt "upset"      
OL,7,Gafter a police welfare check has met   
OL,8,Ghis Nottingham Forest heroes.          
OL,10,FMiles Green has become a well-known    
OL,11,Ffigure in Carlton, Nottinghamshire,    
OL,12,Fsinging on the corner near the One     
OL,13,FStop he works at almost every day.     
OL,15,FLast month, dozens of people gathered  
OL,16,Fto support the 28-year-old, who has    
OL,17,FDown's syndrome, as he felt he would   
OL,18,Fno longer be able to perform after the 
OL,19,Fpolice visit.                          
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
