OL,4,CBook highlights neurodivergent 'unsung 
OL,5,Cheroes'                                
OL,6,GA book featuring the stories of        
OL,7,Gneurodivergent people celebrates their 
OL,8,Gartistic talent and puts them in the   
OL,9,Gspotlight, a woman behind the          
OL,10,Gpublication has said.                  
OL,12,FFormer art teacher Louise Chandler set 
OL,13,Fup Shine Arts and Well-Being CIC in    
OL,14,FBurton Latimer, Northamptonshire, in   
OL,15,F2022 to provide art activities for     
OL,16,Fyoung people with additional needs.    
OL,18,FThe book, This is Us, explores what    
OL,19,Feach member of the group did over the  
OL,20,Fcourse of a year at Shine sessions,    
OL,21,Fwhich are designed to improve self-    
OL,22,Festeem, self-expression and confidG4/4 
